    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3287020/extras/425028e7c299b5cd18e5316457681cb7.avif?t=1748223491\" width=184 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shar's powers are growing even stronger, but not strong enough! She needs another fatrifice for her plan...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3287020/extras/85e9ed5090cc7742604ff1244e8afcab.webp?t=1748223491\" width=96 height=21 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The third addition to the Fatrifice series!</strong> This time around, it's Delilah's turn. She can't do it alone, though. She will need some help from Shar's minions, each with their own unique abilities! Summon food from the demoness' realm, and watch Delilah expand over and over again as she reaches new sizes!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cute girl who gains weight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of minigames to feed the fatrifice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A selection of Appearances for Delilah.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large selection of upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 areas to visit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 new girls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 30 weight gain stages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different foods to collect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute, fun and lovable story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your favorite chubby chasing demoness.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3287020/extras/425028e7c299b5cd18e5316457681cb7.avif?t=1748223491\" width=184 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shar's powers are growing even stronger, but not strong enough! She needs another fatrifice for her plan...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3287020/extras/85e9ed5090cc7742604ff1244e8afcab.webp?t=1748223491\" width=96 height=21 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The third addition to the Fatrifice series!</strong> This time around, it's Delilah's turn. She can't do it alone, though. She will need some help from Shar's minions, each with their own unique abilities! Summon food from the demoness' realm, and watch Delilah expand over and over again as she reaches new sizes!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cute girl who gains weight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of minigames to feed the fatrifice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A selection of Appearances for Delilah.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large selection of upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 areas to visit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 new girls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 30 weight gain stages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different foods to collect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute, fun and lovable story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your favorite chubby chasing demoness.</p></li></ul>",
